# Canonical per-table Mongo backend map — THE source of truth for both repos.
#
# Why this file exists: the map used to live only in deploy-kit/.env.deploy,
# which is gitignored and SHARED by every repo's deploy. Sourcing it exported
# MONGO_STORE_BACKEND into the deploy shell, where it beat trading-service's
# in-script default and was taken verbatim by trading-client — so an unrelated
# deploy (a scraper fix, a docs rebuild) could ship a table cutover nobody
# chose. On 2026-08-16 that file stood at 30 tables at `mongo`, including the
# money ledger and pipeline_state, while both containers ran the 13 below.
# See trading-client documentation ch.66 (F1) and ch.67 (phase 0.1).
#
# Modes, per table: pg | dual | mongo_read | mongo
#   pg          reads and writes Postgres only (the default for any table
#               not named here)
#   dual        writes both stores, reads Postgres
#   mongo_read  writes both stores, reads Mongo (Postgres stays fresh for
#               direct-PG readers)
#   mongo       Mongo only — Postgres writes RAISE via app/db/pg_write_guard.py
#
# Promotion is one step at a time, and never to `mongo` without an EXHAUSTIVE
# parity verify (`pg_to_mongo_backfill.py <table> --verify-all`). A sampled
# verify is not a parity guarantee: it scored context_blobs OK three times out
# of four while a full sweep found 117 drifted timestamps and 2 missing
# documents (ch.66 F6).
#
# Changing a table's mode means editing THIS file and deploying. Both repos'
# deploy scripts read it; deploy-kit/.env.deploy no longer participates unless
# a human sets MONGO_STORE_ALLOW_ENV_OVERRIDE=1 for that one run.
#
# Keep this in sync with app/db/migration_ledger.json's `mode_now` fields.
# scripts/check_backend_map.py asserts they agree and fails the build if not.

MONGO_STORE_BACKEND=pipeline_events:mongo_read,execution_errors:dual,cycle_audit_log:dual,agent_audit_log:dual,llm_audit_logs:mongo_read,agent_traces:dual,agent_tool_telemetry:dual,v3_agent_telemetry:dual,trade_results:mongo_read,ticker_reports:mongo_read,analysis_results:mongo_read,context_blobs:dual,embeddings:mongo
